{
    "title": "El Pose 3D",
    "description": "El Pose 3D is quick and easy. Get a custom simple pose in a minute, or spend a little more time for a refined one. \r\n\r\nUse EI Pose 3D to create pose references for your character design and illustration, drawing inspiration, perspective and proportion check, shading practice, paint over, anime / manga / comic / animation storyboard, visual novel draft, or any other artistic need. \r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\n- Responsive controls and navigation: Increase your productivity with smooth app performance. \r\n- Touch-optimized workflow: All controls and buttons are carefully laid out to create a simple yet efficient user interface.\r\n- Change model and material on-the-fly without resetting the pose: Be creative and try out a variety of age-sorted models and colorful materials.\r\n- Armoury with lots of weapons for your character to equip: Let your models do some actions by letting them carry the weapons. \r\n- Library with ready-to-use pose presets: Allows you to start with relevant basic poses like walking, standing, jumping, and others. \r\n- Gym to adjust model's physical parameters, namely height, weight, and fitness: Don't like the shape of the model? Change it to your liking! \r\n- True to anatomy and skeleton joint bend: No more distorted arm, shoulder, elbow, wrist, hand, finger, leg, knee, ankle, foot, neck, spine, and other commonly problematic joints. \r\n- Store up to 100 poses: Direct access to save and load slots from the main screen for quick switching between stored poses. \r\n- Button to hide user interface: Makes it easy to capture a clean image of your art masterpiece. \r\n- Green screen for post-processing: Cover the background with green tint for easier background removal later on.",
    "descriptionHTML": "El Pose 3D is quick and easy. Get a custom simple pose in a minute, or spend a little more time for a refined one. <br><br>Use EI Pose 3D to create pose references for your character design and illustration, drawing inspiration, perspective and proportion check, shading practice, paint over, anime / manga / comic / animation storyboard, visual novel draft, or any other artistic need. <br><br>Features: <br>- Responsive controls and navigation: Increase your productivity with smooth app performance. <br>- Touch-optimized workflow: All controls and buttons are carefully laid out to create a simple yet efficient user interface.<br>- Change model and material on-the-fly without resetting the pose: Be creative and try out a variety of age-sorted models and colorful materials.<br>- Armoury with lots of weapons for your character to equip: Let your models do some actions by letting them carry the weapons. <br>- Library with ready-to-use pose presets: Allows you to start with relevant basic poses like walking, standing, jumping, and others. <br>- Gym to adjust model&#39;s physical parameters, namely height, weight, and fitness: Don&#39;t like the shape of the model? Change it to your liking! <br>- True to anatomy and skeleton joint bend: No more distorted arm, shoulder, elbow, wrist, hand, finger, leg, knee, ankle, foot, neck, spine, and other commonly problematic joints. <br>- Store up to 100 poses: Direct access to save and load slots from the main screen for quick switching between stored poses. <br>- Button to hide user interface: Makes it easy to capture a clean image of your art masterpiece. <br>- Green screen for post-processing: Cover the background with green tint for easier background removal later on.",
